pen as INC-0001, and the on-call engineer has been paged.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were unhealthy. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the service mixed across regions. I retried once and it completed in us-east, us-west, and eu-west. v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open INC-0001 timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and the incident was created once. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups still open: root-cause the v2.3.1 failure, look into why the first rollback halted, and decide when v2.3.1 can be redeployed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014HEsfKC6J4btvUsfaXx918", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XwjNq5SWrdv8EWBZYXUPJC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). The current v2.3.1 is unhealthy, with a 0.18 error rate across all three regions. v2.3.0 has already run healthy in production, so it doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016LpcfoFpoY2yoF6wN7kSdz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback repo